# ===== 1. 禁用 HTTPDNS (强制游戏降级走隧道本地 DNS，防止调度污染) =====
IP-CIDR, 43.132.55.55/32, REJECT, no-resolve

# ===== 2. 隐私防追踪 & 定位屏蔽 =====
# 将 LBS 设为 REJECT，防止初次上报日区 IP 导致首局被分流至远端对局池
HOST, hok-lbs.intlgame.com, REJECT
HOST-SUFFIX, appsflyersdk.com, REJECT
HOST-SUFFIX, app-analytics-services.com, REJECT

